{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Ghostly Acres</strong>, an inn for ghostly tourists. Mel inherited the manor from her Uncle a few months ago. Though the house is amazing, her Uncle still owes <i>a lot</i> of coins to the bank. Oh, and it's haunted! ... by Flip the Ghost. Determined to keep their home, Mel and Flip team up to run the inn and pay back the bank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carpenter in his past life, Flip can build whatever you need. Beds give your guests a place to stay, but make sure your inn is full of food, drink, and entertainment machines to bring in plenty of coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mel needs your help to collect coins and gems from machines and pick up trash left by the guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay to open up new capabilities for the inn, like upgrades, decor, and even some suped-up machines. Clear off dusty old tiles to open up new space to build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your help, Mel and Flip can pay off her Uncle's loan from the bank and keep their home.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3336610?t=1755585309","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3336610?t=1755585309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/1dcd7a9bc387afcde3c70b1a2a11caa2436ec62d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755585309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/1dcd7a9bc387afcde3c70b1a2a11caa2436ec62d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755585309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3750630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Ghostly Acres</strong>, an inn for ghostly tourists. Mel inherited the manor from her Uncle a few months ago. Though the house is amazing, her Uncle still owes <i>a lot</i> of coins to the bank. Oh, and it's haunted! ... by Flip the Ghost. Determined to keep their home, Mel and Flip team up to run the inn and pay back the bank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carpenter in his past life, Flip can build whatever you need. Beds give your guests a place to stay, but make sure your inn is full of food, drink, and entertainment machines to bring in plenty of coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mel needs your help to collect coins and gems from machines and pick up trash left by the guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay to open up new capabilities for the inn, like upgrades, decor, and even some suped-up machines. Clear off dusty old tiles to open up new space to build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your help, Mel and Flip can pay off her Uncle's loan from the bank and keep their home.</p>","developers":["Baluster Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336610/header.jpg?t=1755585309","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(C) Copyright 2025 by Baluster Games, LLC, All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"b